    <meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="description" content="ESMA’s main roles in the area of settlement are: developing Level 2 measures and supervisory convergence measures related to the EU Regulation on Central Securities Depositories (CSDR), providing information to the market under the Settlement Finality Directive (SFD) and co-ordinating authorities involved in the supervision of CSDs using Target2-Securities (T2S)." />
