</header>

<main role="main">
  <a id="main-content" tabindex="-1"></a>
  
  
  
          
                
  <div class="">
        <div class="row no-gutters ">
            <div class="order-1 order-lg-2 col-12">
          <div class="region region-content">
    

<div class="language-switcher-language-url block block-language block-language-blocklanguage-interface" id="block-languageswitcher" role="navigation">
  
  <div class="container">
    <div class="language">
              
          </div>
        
  </div>

</div>
<article  class="node node--type-esma-page node--view-mode-full" role="article">
	
		

	
	<div  class="node__content">
		<div class="main-summary" style="background-image: url(/sites/default/files/styles/esma_page_main_image/public/main_image/2022/Central%20Securities%20Depositories_Website%20banner.png?itok=nET-EOGa)">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><div class="block block-system block-system-breadcrumb-block">
  
    
        <nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
    <p id="system-breadcrumb" class="visually-hidden" >Breadcrumb</p> 
    <ol class="breadcrumb">
          <li class="breadcrumb-item">
                  <a href="/">Home</a>
              </li>
          <li class="breadcrumb-item">
                  <a href="/esmas-activities">ESMA&#039;s Activities</a>
              </li>
          <li class="breadcrumb-item">
                  <a href="/esmas-activities/markets-and-infrastructure">Markets and Infrastructure</a>
              </li>
          <li class="breadcrumb-item">
                  Central Securities Depositories
              </li>
        </ol>
  </nav>

  </div>
</div>
			<div class="container">
				<h1 class="page-title">
					<span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">Central Securities Depositories</span>

				</h1>
				
						<div class="field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p>ESMA’s main roles in the area of settlement are: developing Level 2 measures and supervisory convergence measures related to the EU Regulation on Central Securities Depositories (CSDR), providing information to the market under the Settlement Finality Directive (SFD) and co-ordinating authorities involved in the supervision of CSDs using Target2-Securities (T2S).</p>
</div>
			
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="main-content">
			<div class="container">
				<article class="node node--type-esma-page node--view-mode-full">
					
			<div class="field field--name-field-page-paragraph field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
													<div id="495" class="field_item text-group primary_grey_background">
			<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--paragraph-esma-page-body paragraph--view-mode--default">
									
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-paragraph-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h3>Central Securities Depositories Regulation (CSDR)</h3>
<p><a href="http://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32014R0909">Regulation (EU) No 909/2014</a>&nbsp;of the European Parliament and of the Council of 23 July 2014 on improving securities settlement in the European Union and on central securities depositories and amending Directives 98/26/EC and 2014/65/EU and Regulation (EU) No 236/2012 (CSDR) was published in the Official Journal on 28 August 2014, and entered into force on 17 September 2014.</p>
<p>The aim of CSDR is to harmonise certain aspects of the settlement cycle and settlement discipline and to provide a set of common requirements for CSDs operating securities settlement systems across the EU. CSDR plays a pivotal role for post-trade harmonisation efforts in Europe, as it enhances the legal and operational conditions for cross-border settlement in the EU.</p>
</div>
      
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-background-color field--type-list-string field--label-hidden field__item">primary_grey_background</div>
      
							</div>
		</div>
	
													<div class="field_item accordion-group primary_grey_background">
			<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--accordion-group paragraph--view-mode--default">
									
      <div class="field field--name-field-accordion-child field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="field__item">						<div id="Keyelements" class="field_item primary_grey_background">
			<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--accordion paragraph--view-mode--default">
									
            <h3 class= "accordion-title field--name-field-paragraph-accordion-title ui-accordion-header ui-corner-top ui-state-default ui-accordion-icons field__item">
      <span class="ui-accordion-header-icon ui-icon ui-icon-triangle-1-s"> </span>
      <a>Key elements</a>
      </h3>
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-accordion-para field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              						<div id="496" class="field_item text-group white_background">
			<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--paragraph-esma-page-body paragraph--view-mode--default">
									
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-paragraph-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>The main objective of CSDR is to increase the safety and efficiency of securities settlement and settlement infrastructures (CSDs) in the EU by providing, among others, for the following:</p>
<ul>
<li>Shorter settlement periods;</li>
<li>Settlement discipline measures (mandatory cash penalties and ‘buy-ins’ for settlement fails, settlement fails reporting);</li>
<li>An obligation regarding dematerialisation for most securities;</li>
<li>Strict prudential and conduct of business rules for CSDs;</li>
<li>Strict access rights to CSD services; and</li>
<li>Increased prudential and supervisory requirements for CSDs and other institutions providing banking services ancillary to securities settlement.</li>
</ul>
<p>Additional information can be found on<strong>&nbsp;</strong>the&nbsp;<a href="https://finance.ec.europa.eu/capital-markets-union-and-financial-markets/financial-markets/post-trade-services/central-securities-depositories-csds_en">European Commission webpage on CSDs</a>&nbsp;and its two CSDR-related FAQs.</p>
</div>
      
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-background-color field--type-list-string field--label-hidden field__item">white_background</div>
      
							</div>
		</div>
	
          </div>
  
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-background-color field--type-list-string field--label-hidden field__item">primary_grey_background</div>
      
							</div>
		</div>
	</div>
              <div class="field__item">						<div id="CSDRRefit" class="field_item primary_grey_background">
			<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--accordion paragraph--view-mode--default">
									
            <h3 class= "accordion-title field--name-field-paragraph-accordion-title ui-accordion-header ui-corner-top ui-state-default ui-accordion-icons field__item">
      <span class="ui-accordion-header-icon ui-icon ui-icon-triangle-1-s"> </span>
      <a>CSDR Refit</a>
      </h3>
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-accordion-para field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              						<div id="498" class="field_item text-group white_background">
			<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--paragraph-esma-page-body paragraph--view-mode--default">
									
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-paragraph-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p><span>In 2020, the European commission launched a review of CSDR.In addition to publishing four reports on the implementation of certain aspects of CSDR (see below), in May 2021, ESMA wrote a&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.esma.europa.eu/sites/default/files/library/esma70-156-4519_letter_to_ec_-_csdr_review.pdf"><span>letter</span></a><span>&nbsp;to the European Commission to present proposals for the review. The&nbsp;</span><a href="https://ec.europa.eu/info/publications/220316-central-securities-depositories-regulation-review_en"><span>EC legislative proposal</span></a><span>&nbsp;was published on 16 March 2022.&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><a href="https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32023R2845"><span>Regulation (EU) 2023/2845</span></a><span>&nbsp;(CSDR Refit) was published on 27 December 2023 and notably modified the settlement discipline regime, the review and evaluation process, the passporting process as well as third-country CSD reporting requirements. Additional information can be found on the European Commission website.</span></p>
</div>
      
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-background-color field--type-list-string field--label-hidden field__item">white_background</div>
      
							</div>
		</div>
	
          </div>
  
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-background-color field--type-list-string field--label-hidden field__item">primary_grey_background</div>
      
							</div>
		</div>
	</div>
              <div class="field__item">						<div id="ShorteningthesettlementcycletoT+1" class="field_item primary_grey_background">
			<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--accordion paragraph--view-mode--default">
									
            <h3 class= "accordion-title field--name-field-paragraph-accordion-title ui-accordion-header ui-corner-top ui-state-default ui-accordion-icons field__item">
      <span class="ui-accordion-header-icon ui-icon ui-icon-triangle-1-s"> </span>
      <a>Shortening the settlement cycle to T+1</a>
      </h3>
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-accordion-para field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              						<div id="12108" class="field_item text-group white_background">
			<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--paragraph-esma-page-body paragraph--view-mode--default">
									
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-paragraph-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p><span>Further to a </span><a href="/sites/default/files/2024-11/ESMA74-2119945925-1969_Report_on_shortening_settlement_cycle.pdf"><span>report</span></a><span>&nbsp;developed by ESMA on the assessment of the shortening of the settlement cycle in the EU, the European Commission </span><a href="https://ec.europa.eu/commission/presscorner/detail/en/ip_25_446"><span>proposed</span></a><span>&nbsp;to reduce the settlement cycle from two days to one. The corresponding legislative amendments to CSDR, mandating the transition of the EU to a T+1 settlement cycle by 11 October 2027, have now been published: </span><a href="https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=OJ:L_202502075"><span>Regulation (EU) 2025/2075</span></a></p>
<p><span>For details on the transition process, please see </span><a href="/esmas-activities/markets-and-infrastructure/shortening-settlement-cycle-t1-eu"><span>this dedicated page</span></a><span>.</span></p>
</div>
      
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-background-color field--type-list-string field--label-hidden field__item">white_background</div>
      
							</div>
		</div>
	
          </div>
  
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-background-color field--type-list-string field--label-hidden field__item">primary_grey_background</div>
      
							</div>
		</div>
	</div>
          </div>
  
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-background-color field--type-list-string field--label-hidden field__item">primary_grey_background</div>
      
							</div>
		</div>
	
													<div id="507" class="field_item text-group primary_grey_background">
			<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--paragraph-esma-page-body paragraph--view-mode--default">
									
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-paragraph-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p><span><strong>CSDR applies primarily to (1) CSDs, including (2) third country CSDs, but also to (3) settlement internalisers (see below).</strong></span></p>
</div>
      
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-background-color field--type-list-string field--label-hidden field__item">primary_grey_background</div>
      
							</div>
		</div>
	
													<div id="12119" class="field_item text-group main_blue_background">
			<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--paragraph-esma-page-body paragraph--view-mode--default">
									
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-paragraph-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h3>CSDs</h3>
</div>
      
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-background-color field--type-list-string field--label-hidden field__item">main_blue_background</div>
      
							</div>
		</div>
	
													<div class="field_item accordion-group primary_grey_background">
			<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--accordion-group paragraph--view-mode--default">
									
      <div class="field field--name-field-accordion-child field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="field__item">						<div id="Level2measures" class="field_item primary_grey_background">
			<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--accordion paragraph--view-mode--default">
									
            <h3 class= "accordion-title field--name-field-paragraph-accordion-title ui-accordion-header ui-corner-top ui-state-default ui-accordion-icons field__item">
      <span class="ui-accordion-header-icon ui-icon ui-icon-triangle-1-s"> </span>
      <a>Level 2 measures</a>
      </h3>
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-accordion-para field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              						<div id="508" class="field_item text-group white_background">
			<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--paragraph-esma-page-body paragraph--view-mode--default">
									
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-paragraph-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><div>
<table>
